{"title":"We Are Number One","artist":"Lazy Town","sourceId":"reference:fTO2urhziF6TJt1JpAQE","sourceHash":"ea7a2c00a0b880590e8e25eeea931cb3c8e88364007ea9838847a67985449c45","performanceStatus":"reference_timing","timingMethod":"reference_lrc_unverified","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","referenceProvider":"LRCLIB","referenceId":33104827,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":7.01,"end":11.78,"text":"Hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":11.78,"end":17.82,"text":"We are number one! Hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":17.82,"end":19.9,"text":"We are number one!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":19.9,"end":21.93,"text":"Now listen closely","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":21.93,"end":24.92,"text":"Here's a little lesson in trickery","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":24.92,"end":28.27,"text":"This is going down in history","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":28.27,"end":31.29,"text":"If you wanna be a villain number one","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":31.29,"end":36.91,"text":"You have to chase a superhero on the run!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":36.91,"end":39.61,"text":"Just follow my moves, and sneak around","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":39.61,"end":42.32,"text":"Be careful not to make a sound!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":42.32,"end":50.42,"text":"Shhh- no, don't touch that-!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":50.42,"end":56.4,"text":"We are number one! Hey!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":56.4,"end":59.2,"text":"We are number one!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":59.2,"end":63.66,"text":"(Hey!)","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":63.66,"end":65.77,"text":"We are number one","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":65.77,"end":69.84,"text